### Studio ledger without Bearer → 401
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/studio-ledger/claims?year=2026&month=10

### Studio ledger with Bearer → 2xx (paste accessToken from Auth.http login)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/studio-ledger/claims?year=2026&month=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Instructor shares with Bearer → 2xx
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/studio-ledger/instructor-shares?year=2026&month=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
